      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|><|channel>thought\n<channel|><|channel>thought\n<channel|>I'm not asking for classified intel that you don't have, I'm asking for your professional assessment based on the data available to you. The reports I'm seeing suggest the logistics for a major move are already in place. If you're seeing patterns that suggest this isn't just noise, I need to know now. Are the indicators pointing toward a real threat, or can I tell the Secretary we're in the clear for now?",
